OL,3,GNEWSAOctopus by-law 'forcing me out of
OL,4,Afishing'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSam Jago's family have been fishing in
OL,7,FCornish waters since the 1700s.
OL,9,FBut that generations-old tradition has
OL,10,Fbeen halted due to by-laws passed to
OL,11,Fprotect crab and lobster stocks after
OL,12,Fan invasion of Mediterranean octopus.
OL,14,FJago's wooden fishing boat is 58 years
OL,15,Fold, but, at more than 12m (39ft) long,
OL,16,Fhas been outlawed by the new rules
OL,17,Fwhich ban larger vessels setting
OL,18,Fshellfish pots in coastal waters.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,344,340,200,160,0,100
