OL,3,GNEWSAOctopus by-law 'forcing me out of
OL,4,Afishing'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Cornwall Inshore Fisheries
OL,7,FAuthority (IFCA) said the by-laws,
OL,8,Fwhich also restrict the volume of
OL,9,Fspecific tanks for crab and lobster
OL,10,Fstorage, would help prevent
OL,11,Fover-fishing.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
